		(uuid "431f9ab7-ac50-5849-951d-04ae99178596")
	)
	(text "3. FAST PATH (below ~63 V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 15.24 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 2 2)
				)
				(justify left top)
			)
		(uuid "176c239c-f54d-515d-b462-96d192e97fe1")
	)
	(text "TF1 (thermal cutoff, 133 °C) clamped to the R_fast1 body:\nopens if a live supply keeps Q2 on (R_fast1 > 7 W).\nQ2 tab = drain (HV): insulate HS1 from it with the Fischer MST 220 set.\nHS1 (HS-S01) slips onto the tab: no solder pins, electrically floating."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 63.5 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify left top)
			)
		(uuid "e6d6222a-a8a6-5cd3-b76c-9ec6749faf0f")
	)
	(text "4. THRESHOLD (~63 V) + GATE DRIVE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 93.98 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 2 2)
				)
				(justify left top)
			)
		(uuid "61fa9380-d5bb-56e9-93b3-ea7079646fe1")
	)
	(text "Above ~63 V: Q1 saturates → GATE_TOP low → Q2 off (slow path only).\nBelow ~63 V: Q1 off → R5 pulls GATE_TOP up to 12 V (D9) → Q2 on (fast path).\nR4 + C_byp2: gate filter, keeps Q2 off during hot-plug."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 139.7 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify left top)
			)
		(uuid "66db4c85-ad25-5606-ae16-9bb102b74254")
	)
	(text "5. DANGER LED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.08 93.98 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 2 2)
				)
				(justify left top)
			)
		(uuid "c9113473-5d65-58e2-a673-ba3123e8fa2a")
	)
	(text "LED off below\n8.2 V + 2 V ≈ 10.2 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.08 154.94 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify left top)
			)
		(uuid "e3947bea-9832-5efa-8d55-fb968daf67e5")
	)
	(text "6. VOLTMETER: 10 000:1 DIVIDER → PM-128"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 93.98 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 2 2)
				)
				(justify left top)
			)
		(uuid "4f63284b-5861-5885-a326-21f424deeff7")
	)
	(text "600 V → 60 mV → display \"600\". Decimal-point jumpers P1–P3 open; calibrate with PM-128 trimmer R4.\nD_clamp1 holds VIN ≤ 0.7 V if both bottom resistors open.\nDVM1 + BT1 are off-board (soldered wires to the PM-128 pads). BT1 FLOATS: never connect\nthe battery to circuit GND (PM-128 requires separate supply and input grounds)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 162.56 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify left top)
			)
		(uuid "be7048d1-1e56-52f4-ac83-d7d4529341b5")
	)
	(text "7. MECHANICAL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 269.24 15.24 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 2 2)
				)
				(justify left top)
			)
		(uuid "366c3984-e475-5b9d-9d8a-f9f338848801")
	)
	(text "PCB ZONES\nHV: J3/J4, bridge, F1, R_slow1-5, R_fast1, TF1, Q2, the R_LED/R_sig chains, the HVp pads of R1/R5.\nLV: Q1, R2-R4, D9, C_byp2, D_LED1, LED1, divider bottom, J5. R1/R5 cross a milled slot.\nClearance = 1 mm per 100 V of worst-case difference, 6 mm HV to GND/LV (hv_rules.py)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 190.5 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 1.5 1.5)
				)
				(justify left top)
			)
		(uuid "851054f0-d3d0-51d6-82b7-368335f19332")
	)
